msgstr "Points forts"

msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Limites"

msgid "For the discussion"
msgstr "Pour la discussion"

msgid "The slides are written from the paper. It takes about a minute."
msgstr ""
"Les slides sont écrites à partir de l'article. Cela prend environ une "
