msgstr ""
"Votre abonnement Premium comprend désormais de nouveaux outils pour "
"chercheurs :"

msgid ""
"Journal club slides, what changed between two versions of a paper, and the "
"open questions of your collections, from the paper and collection pages."
msgstr ""
"Des slides de journal club, ce qui a changé entre deux versions d'un "
"article, et les questions ouvertes de vos collections, depuis les pages des "
"articles et des collections."

msgid "All the tools:"
msgstr "Tous les outils :"

msgid ""
"Thank you for supporting SummarizePaper. Reply to this email to tell us what"
